    "type": "game",
    "name": "All Our Broken Parts",
    "steam_appid": 3473430,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN US!!</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discord:\u00a0</strong>TinBirdGames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BlueSky</strong>:TinBirdGames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>X</strong>:\u00a0TinBirdGames</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Pick up your screwdriver and wire cutters, rid the robots of their malfunctions, pains and nightmares.</i></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a story-driven cyborg doctor simulation game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These fragile mechanical lifeforms suffer from rejection, decay, and disease. As a doctor, your job is to patch them up\u2014and send them back to work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange calm hangs over your days\u2014until a single accident pulls everything apart, dragging you into a dangerous journey to uncover the hidden past and uncertain future of this robotic city.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/68d3c17e46691915c509ba963848afbc.poster.avif?t=1752079007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/68d3c17e46691915c509ba963848afbc.webm?t=1752079007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/68d3c17e46691915c509ba963848afbc.mp4?t=1752079007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Cast of Broken Souls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/8363bbe54acd304344e76a3770b088ea.poster.avif?t=1752079007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/8363bbe54acd304344e76a3770b088ea.webm?t=1752079007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/8363bbe54acd304344e76a3770b088ea.mp4?t=1752079007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cargo bot powered by its own body</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A drawing bot parasitized by AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bartender bot brewing liquor with tears</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character is more than mere cold machinery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack into them, experience their stories, and uncover the delicate emotions of these robots. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like choices and delimmas we encounter in our city life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Disassemble. Diagnose. Repair. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/4f37b33d985d6c83bf810b69cc0c7303.poster.avif?t=1752079007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/4f37b33d985d6c83bf810b69cc0c7303.webm?t=1752079007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/4f37b33d985d6c83bf810b69cc0c7303.mp4?t=1752079007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanical failures. Rejection syndromes. Emotional instability. Robots get sick too. Disassemble their bodies, dive into their circuitry, and heal them\u2014just like fixing a machine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the secrets hidden in this robotic city.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/de8e932c7038659c318f324228f0b77a.poster.avif?t=1752079007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/de8e932c7038659c318f324228f0b77a.webm?t=1752079007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/de8e932c7038659c318f324228f0b77a.mp4?t=1752079007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why would robots eat canned food? Where have humans gone? What is the ultimate purpose of a robot? And who\u2019s pulling the strings? Uncover the answers to these questions in <i>Love &amp; Robot Repair.</i> Your treatments and decisions may even shape the city's fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A retro pixel audiovisual experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/f8710e90ad8d0f510a4658a5485a4c77.poster.avif?t=1752079007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/f8710e90ad8d0f510a4658a5485a4c77.webm?t=1752079007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/f8710e90ad8d0f510a4658a5485a4c77.mp4?t=1752079007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are moments of beauty even in this busy robotic city. Raindrops tapping on your bed. A sunset glimpsed from the overpass. A blurred silhouette from a memory long forgotten\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn off the lights. Let the pixels and melodies stir your thoughts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Develpoer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are Tin Bird \u2014 a team of drifters just like you, trying to make a living beneath the towering city. <br>In the noise of this steel jungle, we often feel numb \u2014 like machines slowly breaking down. <br>So we created these robots, and their stories. <br>We let them cry, laugh, struggle. <br>We let them feel confused, desperate. <br>And we let them try to love \u2014 and be loved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you\u2019ll hear their voices in <i>All Our Broken Parts.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And maybe, hear your *own* voice too.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Pick up your screwdriver and wire cutters, rid the robots of their malfunctions, pains and nightmares.</i></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a story-driven cyborg doctor simulation game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These fragile mechanical lifeforms suffer from rejection, decay, and disease. As a doctor, your job is to patch them up\u2014and send them back to work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange calm hangs over your days\u2014until a single accident pulls everything apart, dragging you into a dangerous journey to uncover the hidden past and uncertain future of this robotic city.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/68d3c17e46691915c509ba963848afbc.poster.avif?t=1752079007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/68d3c17e46691915c509ba963848afbc.webm?t=1752079007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/68d3c17e46691915c509ba963848afbc.mp4?t=1752079007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Cast of Broken Souls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/8363bbe54acd304344e76a3770b088ea.poster.avif?t=1752079007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/8363bbe54acd304344e76a3770b088ea.webm?t=1752079007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/8363bbe54acd304344e76a3770b088ea.mp4?t=1752079007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></v