8f0b77a.webm?t=1752079007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/de8e932c7038659c318f324228f0b77a.mp4?t=1752079007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why would robots eat canned food? Where have humans gone? What is the ultimate purpose of a robot? And who\u2019s pulling the strings? Uncover the answers to these questions in <i>Love &amp; Robot Repair.</i> Your treatments and decisions may even shape the city's fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A retro pixel audiovisual experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/f8710e90ad8d0f510a4658a5485a4c77.poster.avif?t=1752079007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/f8710e90ad8d0f510a4658a5485a4c77.webm?t=1752079007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/f8710e90ad8d0f510a4658a5485a4c77.mp4?t=1752079007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are moments of beauty even in this busy robotic city. Raindrops tapping on your bed. A sunset glimpsed from the overpass. A blurred silhouette from a memory long forgotten\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn off the lights. Let the pixels and melodies stir your thoughts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Develpoer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are Tin Bird \u2014 a team of drifters just like you, trying to make a living beneath the towering city. <br>In the noise of this steel jungle, we often feel numb \u2014 like machines slowly breaking down. <br>So we created these robots, and their stories. <br>We let them cry, laugh, struggle. <br>We let them feel confused, desperate. <br>And we let them try to love \u2014 and be loved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you\u2019ll hear their voices in <i>All Our Broken Parts.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And maybe, hear your *own* voice too.</p>",
